# tmserver/content carries the game content tmServer loads at boot (rates,
# BaseMob/BaseSummon templates, serv00.htm, maps), so it stays in the build
# context. _legacy is the archived Win32 runtime (DLLs, launchers, dumps) and
# never enters the image.
